# Configuration template.
#
# Local development: copy this file to backend/.env and set SECRET.
# Docker: copy this file to .env in this directory and set SECRET; the compose
# files provide HOST, SQLITE_PATH and the metrics settings for the container.
#
# Generate a secret with: cd backend && go run cmd/secrets/main.go
HOST=127.0.0.1
PORT=8080
SQLITE_PATH=db.sqlite
SECRET=
METRICS_ENABLED=false
METRICS_PORT=8081
